,{"cond":["quest 245 is 2"],"reply":"You have delivered that letter? You are a true postofficer. All over the land bards shall praise your name. There are no missions for you left right now.","fx":["quest 248 becomes 1","quest 249 becomes 5"]},{"cond":["quest 244 is 1"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Deliver those letters to Santa. Please report back when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 243 is 1"],"reply":"So Waldo is dead? This is grave news indeed. Did you recover his posthorn?"},{"cond":["quest 234 is 7"],"reply":"Once more you have impressed me! Are you willing to do another job?"},{"cond":["quest 233 is 10"],"reply":"Excellent! Another job well done! Would you accept another mission?","fx":["quest 249 becomes 3"]},{"cond":["quest 231 is 1"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Deliver that present to Fibula. Please report back when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 231 is 2"],"reply":"Splendid, I knew we could trust you. I would like to ask for your help in another matter. Are you interested?"},{"cond":["quest 230 is 1"],"reply":"Do you bring ONE bone for our officers' safety fund or ALL bones at once?"},{"cond":["quest 230 above 20"],"reply":"You have made it! We have enough bones for the fund! You remind me of myself when I was young! Interested in another mission?"},{"cond":["quest 229 is 3"],"reply":"You truly got him? Quite impressive. You are a very prommising candidate! I think I have another mission for you. Are you interested?"},{"cond":["quest 228 is 1"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. The mailbox is still not fixed. Report if you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 228 is 2"],"reply":"Excellent, you got it fixed! This will teach this mailbox a lesson indeed! Are you interested in another assignment?"},{"cond":["quest 227 below 5"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Make sure all the passages are secure. Report if you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 227 is 5"],"reply":"So you have finally made it! I did not think that you would have it in you ... However: are you ready for another assignment?"}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Excellent. Here is a letter for you to deliver. Well, to be honest, no one else volunteered. It's a letter from the mother of Markwin, the king of Mintwallin. Deliver that letter to him, but note that you will not be welcome there.","fx":["quest 245 becomes 1","you get letter to Markwin"],"alts":[{"other":true,"reply":"Too bad, perhaps another time then."}]}]$j$::jsonb, text = 'Back to Kevin for the last mission. Mission 10: a letter from his mother for Markwin in Mintwallin. A stealth ring helps: the first time you talk to Markwin he calls 7 minotaur bodyguards.', updated_at = now()
where id = 852 and updated_at = '2026-11-24T19:48:37.137414+00:00';

-- step 826 (The Postman Missions Quest): conditions/alternatives rebuilt from the corrected NPC data
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = $j$[{"say":"hi","reply":"Greetings <your name>, what brings you here?"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"Oh yes, where did we get that from ...? Let's see, first ask the great technomancer in Kazordoon for the technical details. Return here afterwards.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 3"],"cond":["quest 233 is 2"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 233 is 8"],"reply":"Fine, fine. I think that should do it. Tell Hugo that we order those uniforms. The completed dress pattern will soon arrive in Venore. Report to me when you have talked to him.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 9"]},{"cond":["quest 233 is 6"],"reply":"The queen has sent me the samples we needed. The next part is tricky. We need the uniforms to emanate some odor that dogs hate.The dog with the best 'taste' in that field is Noodles, the dog of King Tibianus. Do you understand so far?"},{"cond":["quest 233 is 4"],"reply":"The mail with Talphion's instructions just arrived. I remember we asked Queen Eloise of Carlin for the perfect colours. Go there, ask her about the UNIFORMS and report back here.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 5"]}]}]$j$::jsonb, updated_at = now()
where id = 826 and updated_at = '2026-11-24T19:48:37.137414+00:00';

-- step 827 (The Postman Missions Quest): conditions/alternatives rebuilt from the corrected NPC data
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = $j$[{"say":"hi","reply":"HIHOOOO <your name>! <waves his hands>"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"DRESS FLATTEN? WHO WANTS ME TO FLATTEN A DRESS?","cond":["quest 233 is 3"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 233 not 3"],"reply":"DRESS FLATTEN? WHO WANTS ME TO FLATTEN A DRESS?"}]},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"A PRESS LANTERN? NEVER HEARD ABOUT IT!"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"CHESS? I DONT PLAY CHESS!"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"A PATTERN IN THIS MESS?? HEY DON'T INSULT MY MACHINEHALL!"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"AH YES! I WORKED ON THE DRESS PATTERN FOR THOSE UNIFORMS. STAINLESS TROUSERS, STEAM DRIVEN BOOTS! ANOTHER MARVEL TO BEHOLD! I'LL SEND A COPY TO KEVIN IMEDIATELY!","fx":["quest 233 becomes 4"]}]$j$::jsonb, updated_at = now()
where id = 827 and updated_at = '2026-11-24T19:48:37.137414+00:00';

