45 is 2"],"reply":"You have delivered that letter? You are a true postofficer. All over the land bards shall praise your name. There are no missions for you left right now.","fx":["quest 248 becomes 1","quest 249 becomes 5"]},{"cond":["quest 244 is 1"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Deliver those letters to Santa. Please report back when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 244 is 2"],"reply":"You did it? I hope you did not catch a flu in the cold! However theres another mission for you. Are you interested?"},{"cond":["quest 243 is 1"],"reply":"So Waldo is dead? This is grave news indeed. Did you recover his posthorn?"},{"cond":["quest 234 is 7"],"reply":"Once more you have impressed me! Are you willing to do another job?"},{"cond":["quest 231 is 1"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Deliver that present to Fibula. Please report back when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 231 is 2"],"reply":"Splendid, I knew we could trust you. I would like to ask for your help in another matter. Are you interested?"},{"cond":["quest 230 is 1"],"reply":"Do you bring ONE bone for our officers' safety fund or ALL bones at once?"},{"cond":["quest 230 above 20"],"reply":"You have made it! We have enough bones for the fund! You remind me of myself when I was young! Interested in another mission?"},{"cond":["quest 229 is 3"],"reply":"You truly got him? Quite impressive. You are a very prommising candidate! I think I have another mission for you. Are you interested?"},{"cond":["quest 228 is 1"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. The mailbox is still not fixed. Report if you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 228 is 2"],"reply":"Excellent, you got it fixed! This will teach this mailbox a lesson indeed! Are you interested in another assignment?"},{"cond":["quest 227 below 5"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Make sure all the passages are secure. Report if you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 227 is 5"],"reply":"So you have finally made it! I did not think that you would have it in you ... However: are you ready for another assignment?"}]},{"say":"advancement","reply":"You are worthy indeed. Do you want to advance in our guild?","cond":["quest 250 < quest 249"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 250 >= quest 249"],"reply":"Sorry, but you are not yet ready for advancement."}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"From now on it shall be known that you are a grand postman. You are now a privileged member until the end of days. Most captains around the world have an agreement with our guild to transport our privileged members, like you, for less gold.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 3"],"cond":["quest 249 is 3"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 249 is 2"],"reply":"I grant you the title of postman. You are now a full member of our guild. Here have your own officers hat and wear it with pride.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 2","you get post officers hat"]},{"cond":["quest 249 is 4"],"reply":"From now on you are a grand postman for special operations. You are an honoured member of our guild and earned the privilege of your own post horn. Here, take it.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 4","you get post horn"]},{"cond":["quest 249 is 5"],"reply":"I grant you the title of archpostman. You are a legend in our guild. As privilege of your newly aquired status you are allowed to make use of certain mailboxes in dangerous areas. Just look out for them and you'll see.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 5"]}]}]$j$::jsonb, updated_at = now()
where id = 835 and updated_at = '2026-11-24T19:48:37.137414+00:00';

